title: >-
  Bioinfoeasy: A Software Package for Simplifying Bioinformatics Analysis
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mingyuan
    family-names: Zhang
    alias: Zmy0912
    email: myzhang0726@foxmail.com
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Zmy0912/Bioinfoeasy'
url: 'https://github.com/Zmy0912/Bioinfoeasy'
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22712158
version: '0.1.3'
date-released: '2026-10-17'
abstract: >-
  Bioinfoeasy provides a collection of simple and practical bioinformatics
  tools for biological sequence data processing, analysis and visualization,
  covering genome annotation analysis, sequence processing, repeat analysis,
  codon usage bias analysis, Ka/Ks selection pressure, SSR classification and
  publication-quality plotting. Most tools provide both English and Chinese
  interfaces and run entirely on the local machine.
